# Tenant creation and the Active Tenant (ticket 03). Log in first with http/auth.http.
# Switching the Active Tenant uses the refresh-token cookie (see the note in auth.http).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken = paste-access-token
@tenantId = paste-tenant-id
@refreshToken = paste-from-set-cookie

### Create a Tenant (verified email required). You become its Tenant Admin.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme" }

### The Tenants you belong to (Tenant picker)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Make a Tenant your Active Tenant. Returns an access token with tid and mid,
### and a new refresh-token cookie in the same login.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/refresh/active-tenant
Content-Type: application/json
# Cookie: sentinel_refresh={{refreshToken}}

{ "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}" }

### Your Active Tenant (needs an access token from the switch above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
